 </ul>
</nav>

<style>
 .nav-link {
 text-decoration: none;
 padding: 10px;
 display: inline-block;
 color: #333;
 }
 .nav-link:focus {
 outline: 2px solid #0056b3;
 background-color: #e7f1ff;
 }
</style>
```

### Key Accessibility Features:
- **Role and ARIA Labels**: Helps screen readers identify the navigation as the main site navigation.
- **Tabindex**: Ensures navigable links via keyboard.
- **Focus Styles**: Custom focus styles are added to make navigation links visibly distinct when focused, enhancing visibility for keyboard users.

