```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
 <style>
 body {
 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
 }
 .navbar {
 display: flex;
 justify-content: space-between;
 align-items: center;
 background-color: #333;
 padding: 10px;
 }
 .navbar a {
 color: #fff;
 text-decoration: none;
 padding: 8px 16px;
 }
 .navbar a:hover {
 background-color: #575757;
 }
 .navbar .menu {
 display: none;
 }
 @media (min-width: 600px) {
 .navbar .menu {
 display: flex;
 }
 }
 </style>
</head>
<body>
