 </div>
 </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```

**How it works:**
1. The `.accordion` acts as the container for all accordion items.
2. Each `.accordion-header` toggles the visibility of its corresponding `.accordion-content`.
3. Nested accordions can be added within the content section of a parent accordion by using the `.nested-accordion` class.
4. The JavaScript toggles the display property of the content sections to show/hide them.

